e nosy, and the lawn can't hide everyth","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:38:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688218","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4954970-1846651706685806","game_id":"steam-4954970","kind":"update","title":"New Feature : Hand Cuffing Update","summary":"Hey everyone!The police department just got a budget increase. This update gives cops new tools, makes their arrival more dramatic, and fixes a bunch of things you reported. Here's what's new: New: HandcuffsHold the button for 2 seconds to cuff a suspect.Cuffed suspects move slower for 20 seconds and can't carry items or bodies.Suspects who are down on the ground can be cuffed too.Cops can cuff each other as well, but only for 5 seconds. We know you'll try it.New: Radio & SirensPick up the radio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T23:26:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4954970-1846651706682171","game_id":"steam-4954970","kind":"announcement","title":"No Body No Problem! Demo Out Now!","summary":"Hello everyone!The wait is over! We're excited to announce that the No Body No Problem! demo is now available to play for free on Steam!Are you ready to pull off the perfect crime with your friends? Things might not be as easy as you think!There's a body to hide, evidence scattered everywhere, and the police are about to knock on the door. While you and your friends try to hide the body and clean up the crime scene, your friend playing as the police officer searches every corner to uncover the t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:11:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682171","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4954970-1841579228665616","game_id":"steam-4954970","kind":"announcement","title":"The No Body No Problem Community is Now on Discord!","summary":"Hey everyone!We’re happy to announce that the official No Body No Problem Discord server is now open!If you’ve been following the game and want to get closer to the development process, this is the place to be.Join the community, meet other players, talk about the game, share your ideas and feedback, and be among the first to see what we’re working on behind the scenes.What can you expect on the server?Development updates and announcementsSneak peeks and behind-the-scenes contentEarly looks at n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T13:35:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665616","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4954970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4954970":"2026-10-26T05:34:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4954970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5076290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4954970","app_id":4954970,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"k